=\"144576\"><ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>鼻<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>突<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っ<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>むのはよしてくれよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把鼻子放在人的问题上。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">努める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つとめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">努力；竭力；尽力；致力；奋力；尽心尽力</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227053\">お<ruby>手伝<rp>(</rp><rt>てつだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いさんたちは<ruby>主人<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>命令<rp>(</rp><rt>めいれい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>実行<rp>(</rp><rt>じっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しようと<ruby>努<rp>(</rp><rt>つと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">助手们试图遵守主人的命令。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">務める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つとめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\"><span lang=\"en\">to serve；to fill a post；to serve under；to work (for)</span></span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227466\">オリビアがハムレットの<ruby>役<rp>(</rp><rt>やく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>務<rp>(</rp><rt>つと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">Olivier饰演了哈姆雷特一角。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/334996\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=