</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">粒</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つぶ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">粒；珠；滴；粒（用于计数小圆形物体的量词）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"161900\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は６<ruby>時間<rp>(</rp><rt>じかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ごとに２<ruby>粒<rp>(</rp><rt>つぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まなければなりません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我需要每6小时喝2杯。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">潰す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つぶす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">压碎；压扁；压平；关闭；使停业；迫使（公司）关门；破坏；损坏；阻挠；挫折；屠宰；宰杀；杀死（家畜作为食物）；消磨（时间）；打发（时间）；消耗（时间）；浪费（例如才能）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">潰れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つぶれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">被压碎；被压扁；被砸碎；被破坏；被打破；坍塌；破产；倒闭；失败；崩溃；（计划）落空；被取消；（项目等）夭折；泡汤；告吹；（嗓音、视力、嗅觉等）丧失；停止工作；（时间）被占用；被浪费；被耗费；（机会）被错过；被失去；（脸面、镇定等）丧失；（勇气等）受挫；心碎；（笔尖、锯齿等）磨损；磨钝；变钝；烂醉；醉得不省人事</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"141986\"><ruby>雪<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>重<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さで<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がつぶれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">雪的重量打破了房子。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">つまずく</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">绊倒；踩空；失败；遭受挫折</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"155527\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>石<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>につまずいて、<ruby>足首<rp>(</rp><rt>あしくび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をひねってしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我倒在石头上,摇了脚。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">詰まる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">充满；装满；排满（日程等）；堵塞；阻塞；不通；变短；收缩；变窄；陷入困境；（对某事）感到茫然；（被某事）逼迫；告终；了结；尘埃落定；变为促音；（投球）打到球棒靠近打者手部的位置；被内角球顶住</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"198562\">のどが<ruby>詰<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まった<ruby>感<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我的屁股似乎被包围了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">積む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">堆积；堆叠；装载；装货；获得；积累</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"100250\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>幅広<rp>(</rp><rt>はばひろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>経験<rp>(</rp><rt>けいけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>積<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいる<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是一个拥有丰富的经验的人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">爪</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">指甲；爪；趾甲；蹄；拨片；琴拨；钩；扣环</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"152562\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>夜<rp>(</rp><rt>よる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>けっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>爪<rp>(</rp><rt>つめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我从来没有在晚上切断我的指甲。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">艶</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つや</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">光泽；光彩；亮度；润泽；（嗓音的）圆润；（皮肤等的）年轻感；润泽感；趣味；魅力；风情；韵味；气息；浪漫；爱情；性感；风骚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"150980\"><ruby>飼<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>猫<rp>(</rp><rt>ねこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>毛<rp>(</rp><rt>け</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のつやが<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">猫的头发变得更糟。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">強気</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">つよき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自信的；笃定的；坚定的；强硬的；看涨的；牛市的</span></div><div class=\"v-